### create team
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Vitality", "country": "France", "worldRank": 1, "coachName": "XTQZZZ" }

### create player
POST http://localhost:8080/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nickname": "ZywOo", "fullName": "Mathieu Herbaut", "country": "France", "role": "AWPer", "age": 24 }

### list teams
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teams

### list players
GET http://localhost:8080/api/players

### add player to team (replace ids after creating above)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teams/1/addPlayer/1?igl=true

### show roster
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teams/1/roster
